WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Today the program will ask for information and choose what to do next.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:45.000
cin lets us read a value typed by the user.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:15.000
A condition is a true or false question.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:50.000
If the condition is true, one block runs. Otherwise, the else block runs.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Good programmers test both outcomes, not just the one they expect. Now combine two inputs to decide whether the robot is ready for practice.
